  docs/wapiti-analysis.md is the author's design notes. Those notes are not
  Wapiti's code.
- protest/active/mod_sql.py includes a list of regular expressions used to
  recognise database error text. Several of those expressions, including
  alternations that do not appear in the servers' own messages, match the
  patterns shipped in sqlmap's errors.xml. sqlmap is GPL-2.0. That list is
  copied data, not merely the same idea. It is the provenance conflict this
  tree still carries. Replacing the list, or a later licence choice that
